comments.text:
I know it's "too clever", but if I'm writing code no one else will ever see,
while (i --> 0) {
// use array[i]
}
easy to read (if not understand), and correct!

I prefer:
const size_t n = 10;
for (size_t i = n; i --> 0;) {
std::cout << i << "\n";
}

